    "created_at": "2023-03-15T19:43:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-15T19:43:57Z",
    "body": "### Clarification: regarding Chrome's current behavior ...\r\n\r\n1. Chrome _currently exposes the base URL for sandboxed srcdoc_ but **not**  for sandboxed about:blank.\r\n2. We encountered some compatibility issues when trying to remove it from sandboxed srcdoc, which may require investigation.\r\n3. For now, standardizing on not exposing the base URL for sandboxed about:blank seems like a good first step with minimal compat risk, since Chrome already behaves that way.\r\n4. Might be worthwhile to update the srcdoc case in the future, if we can avoid compatibility issues.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
